            "review_text": "anna\nRussia3 contributions\n0\n—\nJan 2025 • Family\nA ruined lunch, an hour in an empty restaurant waiting for the meat that the waitresses were grilling outside, the embers coming in as we were about to leave. \nThey ordered more soup and rice for the kids - soup cloudy fish broth and minced meat in it, a rice-sticky piece. \nIn addition to meat, they ordered salad, it was so spicy that it was impossible to eat it, although they like spicy. It's not on the menu.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten January 13, 2025",
